<title>USA: United Dominion to buy back 2 mln shares.</title>
<headline>United Dominion to buy back 2 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Dominion Industries Ltd said Friday it has authorized a one-year stock repurchase program to buy back up to two million, or approximately 4.4 percent, of United Dominion's outstanding common shares.</p>
<p>The company said it will buy the shares on the open market and plans to cancel the shares purchased under the buyback program.</p>
